## API reference

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `pressed:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Initial state (inside a group, from the group's value). |
| `value:` | `String` | - | Identity inside a ToggleGroup. |
| `disabled:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Disables the button. |

Event: `ui--toggle:change` with `{ pressed }`.

## Accessibility

- A `<button>` with `aria-pressed`; Space or Enter toggles it.
- Give an icon-only toggle an `aria_label:`.
